{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18127","headline":"南溪始泛三首 三 · 韩愈","name":"南溪始泛三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"足弱不能步，自宜收朝蹟。\n羸形可舆致，佳观安事掷。\n即此南坂下，久闻有水石。\n拕舟入其间，溪流正清激。\n随波吾未能，峻濑乍可刺。\n鹭起若导吾，前飞数十尺。\n亭亭柳带沙，团团松冠壁。\n归时还尽夜，谁谓非事役。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18127.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18127","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}